WEBVTT

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:12.990
Ever since you started visiting, the nights are no longer lonely.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.650
The same goes for me.

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:18.950
Your eyes are as radiant as a thousand stars.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.680
And when I gaze into them,

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.920
it feels like they'll become a shooting star which will grant my wishes.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.410
Shooting star?

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.380
Falulu has never seen a shooting star.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.140
That's because there isn't a weather hologramation with one.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.870
Hopefully she will get to see one someday.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:45.130
It would be nice if it would grant Falulu's wish as well.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:23.410
Rina-chan!

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.140
Capisce Mystery.

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:27.540
The PriPara Serial Da Vinci Incidents.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.910
The incidents aren't taking place in the classroom-easel!

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:35.340
They're taking place in PriPara-daVinci!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.300
C-C-C-Cubism!

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.000
Open your eyes, Rina-chan!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.330
Babyon!

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:39.430
Open your eyes, Rina-chan!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:42.220
Clearly she was attacked by someone-art!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.180
Rina-chan, pull yourself together-glo!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.390
She has no pulse.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:49.260
Hey there, can you hear me?

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.100
Can't hear anything.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.730
This is her deathbed, huh?

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.780
Rina-chan!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.320
We've lost someone dear to us.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.990
Thanks for everything!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.710
Girls of the PriPara Police,

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.950
do whatever you can to catch the perpetrator-glo!

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:11.920
But we still need to catch Phantom Thief Genius.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.130
Ham-senpai says we'll solve this case first-rubens.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:22.530
Let's get to searching for Rina-chan's killer-sesshuDaVinci!

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:23.590
Capisce!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.850
Where Dalí is the culprit?

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.930
Is it you-caravaggio?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.460
I'll arrest him!

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.370
Under arrest-nano!

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:37.240
They won't catch Genius in 500 million years doing it like that-pri.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:37.950
Yeah.

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:39.070
In that case,

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.610
we'll have to become private eyes.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.460
If we combine Mirei's calculations and Shion's readings,

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.530
we'll be able to get closer to the truth-pri!

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.080
Yeah.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.150
Genius...

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:52.040
When translated into Japanese, it means prodigy-pri.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.750
There is one other person who is obsessed with prodigies.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.260
<i>Toudou Shion, you are a true prodigy.</i>

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:03.890
<i>For a team that had those two prodigies to lose the GrandPrix...</i>

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:07.350
The acting principal Shikyouin Hibiki-pri!
The acting principal Shikyouin Hibiki-dono!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.660
I don't want to believe it, but it's possible-pri.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.750
He came to Paprika Academy at about the same time as Fuwari.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:20.310
And on top of that, Genius appeared around the time that Fuwari stopped being the princess candidate-pri.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.570
For Shikyouin-dono, the movie star,
a costume like that isn't out of the question.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:29.040
Even his lines are narcissistic and theatrical-pri.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.290
But why did he lead Fuwari to PriPara in the first place?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.010
He's definitely worth investigating-pri!

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:36.750
Agreed.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.460
Hibiki-sama, it is as you've heard.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.900
Let them do what they want.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.680
More importantly,

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.390
Andou, there's something I'd like you to do.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:51.870
I want you to enter PriPara and do a bit of work in my place.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.770
Eh?

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:53.850
Are you...

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:59.030
I'm sure I already taught you how to bypass the Great PriPara Firewall.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.570
Y-You have.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:09.200
Then I shall take on the part of Phantom Thief Genius and perform one act of this masquerade.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.410
No, I've already prepared a fitting costume for you.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.470
Huh?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.170
W-Why a goat?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.340
No, I don't have time to lament over this.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:29.880
Could you help out a pudgy goat-mee?

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:30.920
Mee.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.220
Spotted!

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:52.080
Ponkan has found important evidence-daVinciTitian!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.220
Huh?!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.000
She did!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.080
Now that I take a closer look, there's something written here.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.830
The number 8.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.730
It's a dying message-artNouveau.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.300
Dying message?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.310
Oh, we do that at my house too!

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:07.120
Mama leaves notes about leftovers.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.510
That's a dining message.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:13.220
Rina-chan left us a clue about her assailant!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.110
Exactly!

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.440
An eight can only mean one person-daVinci!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.090
And it is...

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.400
And it is...?

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.550
You're under arrest-renaissance!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.480
What?!

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.070
Under arrest? What's going on-kuma?!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.680
Here lies the number eight-leCorbusier.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.390
That is, when you turn it-daVinci.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.700
I have no clue what you're talking about-kuma.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.100
Usasasa!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.330
What a sorry state you're in-usa.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.290
I'll be sure to bring you veggie juice while you're in jail-usa.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.360
You're under arrest-renaissance!

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.420
What?!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.920
You're his accomplice?!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:46.650
Usa?!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.550
I never thought you two would do something like that!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.270
You're the worst.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.640
You're wrong-kuma!
You're wrong-usa!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.510
Hold it!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.240
Aloma-nano!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:57.430
These two has't accompanied me all day.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:02.940
They were helping with mine own lesson in place of Neko-nee.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.150
<i>Wipeth the floor with yond foul cloth!</i>

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.120
<i>You got it! Mop the floor-kuma!</i>

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:08.630
<i>I'm wiping!</i>

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.440
<i>Offer unto me the demon's essence!</i>

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.990
<i>Some water-usa?</i>

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.350
Pikkari Picasso!

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.330
Your alibi has been proven-titian!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.720
Quit screwing around!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.040
Stop right there!

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:24.250
1, 2, 3... Jellyfish Shock!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.330
Pushushushushuu~.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.680
This'll warm her cold body.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:34.150
Rina-chan, don't leave me all alone-glo!

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.640
Please open your eyes!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.360
Rina-chan!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.610
However, if Genius really is Shikyouin-dono,

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:46.020
as a guy, how is he able to get into PriPara?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.360
Not counting Leona.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.820
Maybe there's another entrance-pri.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.070
Or maybe he's got someone on the inside-pri.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.490
Well, he does have that butler.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.710
If I remember right, his name's Andou Rei.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.340
He's probably hiding somewhere-pri.

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:04.160
Yeah.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.280
Pardon us.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.360
Pri.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.170
Mee, love you-mee.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:24.700
Well done.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.950
Now return to reconnaissance.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.700
PriPara will be closing shortly.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.040
We didn't find the culprit.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.380
This is quite difficult.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:44.740
Unsolved.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:45.740
Nano!

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:49.920
You mustn't say something as selfish as you don't want to leave my side.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.290
Hm?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.110
A message from the chief back at PriPara Police Headquarters?

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.230
<i>I've obtained some valuable evidence related to Geinus.</i>

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:03.260
<i>Make haste and come to PriPari.</i>

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:04.560
<i>What's this?!</i>

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:09.020
The last flight to PriPari is now departing.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.230
Wait!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:19.050
Ladies, I shall return tomorrow afternoon,

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.830
so be good until then.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.540
He didn't even notice it was fake.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.060
Now that that nuisance is gone...

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:38.700
Will Magician-san come again today?

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.710
Please keep your eyes closed.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.300
I have a gift for you this evening.

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.840
A gift?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.660
What could it be?

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.320
You can open them now.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:11.500
Could these be... shooting stars?

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.510
They're sparkling brilliantly.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:17.690
Within the world of PriPara, the one who shines most brilliantly right now...

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:18.720
...is you.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.080
Look around.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:24.680
Even the stars themselves seem to be greeting their princess.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.570
They're sparkling.

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:28.530
Falulu must make a wish!

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:31.690
May Gaalulu steadily get better at singing and dancing.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.540
May Maalulu lose her habit of biting her nails.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.620
May Naalulu get to take a nap.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.670
And...

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:38.950
Falulu...

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.990
Tonight may be the last time I'll be able to visit you like this.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.200
Huh?

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:47.650
Oh...

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:50.960
Falulu will once again be alone at night.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.750
That's not true.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.910
I will see you again soon.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.050
Really?

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.080
Yes.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:59.900
And it'll be in an even more brilliant form.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.460
Then it's a promise?

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.440
Falulu will wish upon a shooting star for it.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.490
What is it, Kuma-san?!

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:14.110
Ah!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.730
What is this-goya!

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.020
Chief Ajimi!

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:22.050
She got ketchup on herself.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:26.910
Poan!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.460
Cure!

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.420
Pull yourself together!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.830
The hell?!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.410
Not only did they get Rina-chan, but now they got Chief Ajimi!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.930
They're getting rid of the funny ones.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.140
Who would do this?!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.370
I have no clue-usa!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.260
We just got here, too-kuma!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.480
Ham-senpai is so devastated that he started running in the opposite direction-kuma!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.320
DaVinci!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.640
S-She came back to life!

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:10.470
She's a zombie!

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:11.580
A zombie teacher!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:15.540
Ponkan was just putting some ketchup on her omelet rice,

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.750
but got it all over herself instead-daVinci.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.660
Eh?!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.210
Don't surprise us like that!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.260
More importantly,

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.970
I've got a grand Picasso-daVinci!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:29.880
That message wasn't an eight, but if you look at it like this-michelangeloDaVinci...

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.430
Now it's a purple butterfly!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.870
A purple butterfly?

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:36.900
Like the one you arrested that one time?

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.920
Absolutely butterfly-lichtenstein.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:40.960
Ah!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.110
There's one right there!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:48.200
Catch it-elGrecoDaVinci!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.410
Hold it right there!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.330
Stop!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.850
PriPara Police on the capisce scene!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.970
You're not getting away-dadaism!

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:12.430
Poan!

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:20.050
Rina-chan?!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.360
It's a miracle-glo!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:24.710
Rina-chan came back to life-glo!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:29.560
As soon as I plugged in Rina-chan...

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.630
It seems she just ran out of juice.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.420
Then we got the whole story from her-glo.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:45.300
<i>I happened to see a strange purple butterfly while on a stroll through PriPara-glo.</i>

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.800
So that's what happened.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.610
Just give it up-lautrec.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.550
My!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:13.040
Rina-chan says she hopes you'll forgive her-glo.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.810
Why, you ask?

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.200
Because this is PriPara!

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.580
We're all friends!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.110
We're all idols!

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.260
That's what Rina-chan is saying.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:31.720
This is when you should exchange Friend Tickets.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.220
I'll lend you mine-glo.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.430
How moving!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:45.170
Now they'll get along.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.570
Guess this case is closed.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:51.780
Let's Gauguin and put on a PriPara Police concert!

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:53.990
Capisce Poan!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.580
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.530
Coord Change Start!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.160
Good job on closing that case!

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.220
The stuffed bears are also happy!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.340
So it'll be a concert with a happy and colourful coord!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.630
Handmade Friends Bear Coord!

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.390
DaVinci!

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.610
Making Drama Switch On!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.030
Wooooo!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.950
You're under arrest!

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.620
PriPara Police!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.750
The Chasing the Phantom Thief reel!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:12.760
We'll catch you next time!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:16.880
Cyalume Change!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:22.440
Yeah!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:23.770
Gel!
Yeah!

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:35.570
The police are here!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:41.990
Rina-chan, bravo to you for making a new friend-glo!

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.620
What's with that butterfly-pri?

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.960
It sure is strange-kuma.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:48.270
The truth is...

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.900
...I've never seen it in PriPara before-usa.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.300
It's not my friend either-kuma.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.030
What?

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:55.870
Then it's from outside?

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.930
That means there's another entrance-pri.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.510
The butterfly said it came from the subway-glo?

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.680
Eh?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.980
The subway elevator!

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.900
The elevator's suspicious?

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:17.900
We've always lost track of Genius around here, too.

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.610
Let's take a look inside-pri.

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:30.290
There doesn't seem to be anything strange in here.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.250
Maybe you need to put in a special number sequence.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.920
Let's play Go.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:42.140
Devi.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:44.500
Glo glo glolo.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.480
Rice is delicious.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.060
Gel...

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:51.320
Be reasonable-pri!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:55.150
If Genius really is the acting principal...

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.530
If he is?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.990
It's French...

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.200
Andou...

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.660
...and Rei!

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:17.570
Oh?!

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:19.720
We returned to normal.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.260
Where are we?

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.180
Where, where, where are we-daVinci?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:28.600
Huh?

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.750
Prism Stone?!

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.310
What's going on here?!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.990
Please patch me through to the police headquarters secretary.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.440
Coming right up!

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.840
Bonjour, Mega-chan!

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:46.820
Nice to see you.

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:47.750
Doing well?

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:51.060
Chief, as far as the message about Genius...

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:51.870
Yes?

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.410
When we talk about it,

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.680
instead of the barbecue we normally have, a simple-

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:56.730
Message?

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.170
I didn't send you any.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.090
Wha'd you say?!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.560
More importantly, let's decide on the date for our next lunch meeting.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.210
I want grilled-

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:07.390
Was this Geinus's doing?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.860
Return to Parajuku on the double!

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:11.440
I have a bad feeling.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.500
Roger.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.060
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.570
<i>If I return now, I'm sure it'll throw him off his game.</i>

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.810
<i>Phantom Thief Genius...</i>

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:24.530
<i>The time at which I finally catch you and reveal your identity is upon us!</i>

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:31.840
We have a problem!

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.880
They've found our gate!

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:19.300
So Phantom Thief Genius's true identity is Shikyouin Hibiki-san?!

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:20.600
I'm sure of it-pri!

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:23.150
Let's ambush him and catch him-pri!

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:23.860
Capisce!

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:24.690
Next time:

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:26.830
The Day of Her Début.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.940
Let me show you how skilled a prodigy truly is.
